    {"type":"MCQ","outcome_code":"10-CBSE-SOC-CIV-PS-01","difficulty":"EASY","cognitive_level":"UNDERSTAND","marks":1,"question":"What was the SOURCE of the tension between Dutch and French speakers in mid-20th century Belgium?","options":["religious","class + language overlap (richer minority French-speakers)","weather","Belgium's small size"],"answer":"class + language overlap (richer minority French-speakers)","explanation":"Class-language overlap."},
